    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31311" root="غب" body-key="g">
    
      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَغبّب</span></b>  is app. from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الغِبُّ</span> in the sense of
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">العَاقِبَةُ</span>, and thus syn. with <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَعَقَّبَ</span> signifying <i>He
looked to the consequence, end, issue,</i> or <i>result,</i> of
an affair: see its part. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُتَغَبِّبْ</span>, below.] ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See
[also] 2, first sentence.

